('P05 · Practical test','Stay on her face through Just fine. Use a distinct table-clearing insert for 2 seconds on the practical meal test, then return for the later time point.','Conversational emphasis on the ordinary standard she wanted.','Hold instead of cutting away from the payoff.','Testimonial timing/result dependency.','PRESENTER'),
